    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A clear outline of we intellectual property ownership and usage rights, ensuring that all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Review and adaptation of we standard contractual clauses to ensure our standard contractual clauses meet The City of Belval's contractual terms, including liability, insurance, and termination provisions. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Confirmation that we will adhere to The City of Belval's policy of sustainable development and reduce energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By addressing these legal risks and requirements, we can ensure that our proposal is compliant with The City of Belval's call for tenders and demonstrates we commitment to meeting The City of Belval's regulatory and contractual needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The total contract value is 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must be compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's pricing model and current financial position, what is our company's projected margin on this contract, and are there any cost-optimization strategies our company's can propose to improve our company's competitiveness?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company's target gross margin percentage is 28%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To calculate our projected margin on this contract, our company's need to first determine the total revenue." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The total contract value is 3 million euros over 4 years, so the average annual revenue would be 750,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Using our company's target gross margin percentage, our company's can estimate our projected margin on this contract as follows:  Projected Margin = the total revenue * Target Gross Margin Percentage Projected Margin = 750,000 euros * 0.28 Projected Margin = 210,000 euros per year Over the 4-year contract period, our projected margin on this contract would be approximately 840,000 euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies to improve competitiveness, our company's could consider proposing a solution that integrates with existing practices and systems, reducing the need for additional infrastructure or training. proposing aligns with our company's pricing model focus on infrastructure margin percentage of 12% and software licence resale margin percentage of 8%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, by leveraging our company's standard daily rates for senior architects, project managers, AI engineers, security engineers, business analysts, junior developers, and change managers, our company's can optimize resource allocation to minimize costs while maintaining the required level of expertise." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more specific details on the contract requirements and scope of work, it's challenging to propose more tailored cost-optimization strategies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nevertheless, our company's target gross margin percentage and pricing model provide a solid foundation for negotiating a competitive contract that balances our company's financial goals with the client's budgetary constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval expects an artificial intelligence solution that can assist agents in agents daily tasks, facilitate access to information, and improve answer quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI technologies and innovations can we leverage to meet these requirements, and how can we ensure that an artificial intelligence solution that can assist agents in their daily tasks, facilitate access to information, and improve answer quality provides a high level of relevance and accuracy?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The City of Belval requirements, we can leverage we expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to provide accurate and relevant answers to agents' queries. we have experience with fine-tuning methods such as LoRA, QLoRA, and full fine-tune on domain corpus, which can help achieve an average accuracy gain of 12%. we Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities include dense vector retrieval, BM25 sparse retrieval, and hybrid retrieval strategies, which can be used to provide relevant information to agents. we also have experience with various vector stores such as Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS. we typical retrieval precision at 5 is 0.87, and we typical answer relevance score is 0.84." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure an artificial intelligence solution that can assist agents in their daily tasks, facilitate access to information, and improve answer quality provides a high level of relevance and accuracy, we can implement explainability and trust features such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. we also have a bias testing process in place, which includes quarterly evaluation on demographically diverse test sets." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, an artificial intelligence solution that can assist agents in their daily tasks, facilitate access to information, and improve answer quality will comply with the EU AI Act limited risk compliance and ensure that the data is protected in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR). we can host the data in the European Union and ensure that the data is not transferred outside the European Union. we approach will also optimize costs and guarantee quality of service while reducing energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval aims to reduce The City of Belval environmental footprint and limit the energetic consumption of The City of Belval systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our proposed solution contribute to aims, and what measures can our take to minimize our proposed solution carbon impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Are there any specific sustainability requirements or certifications that our need to address in our proposal?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can assure you that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is committed to reducing environmental footprint and limiting energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To contribute to aims, our proposed solution can rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact, such as those provided by our green hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can also implement digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching to reduce recomputation by an estimated 20%, and a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has a carbon reporting capability based on the GRI Standards (partial) and typically achieves energy reductions of around 35% compared to baseline levels." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have a partner for e-waste management, Ecologic (France), which is certified for WEEE recycling." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding sustainability requirements or certifications, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are aware of the need to comply with The City of Belval policy of sustainable development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
