        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. current EcoVadis rating is Silver, with a score of 62." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize the carbon impact of our proposed solution, our will consider measures such as hosting data within the European Union, ensuring that our proposed solution does not constitute a rupture in the agents' modes of work, and providing training to agents on the changes. our will also aim to optimize costs while guaranteeing quality of service expected by The City of Belval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By addressing these sustainability aspects, our believe our proposed solution can contribute to reducing the environmental footprint and energetic consumption of its systems, aligning with The City of Belval goals and requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. is pleased to submit a proposal for the City of Belval's artificial intelligence solution project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience in managing large-scale public sector projects, with 23 completed projects and a largest project managed worth 4.5 million euros." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can leverage experience in managing large-scale public sector projects, with 23 completed projects and a largest project managed worth 4.5 million euros to ensure that the City of Belval's artificial intelligence solution project meets the City of Belval's requirements. the City of Belval's artificial intelligence solution project will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from agents' work environments, capable of accompanying agents' in agents' administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool accessible from agents' work environments, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities will assist agents with searching for information in internal procedures and applicable regulations, drafting letters or answers to users, instructing files, and suggesting actions or steps in an administrative process. the City of Belval's artificial intelligence solution project will integrate with existing practices and systems, including business software, civil status, town planning, electronic document management (EDM), and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, the City of Belval's artificial intelligence solution project will respect the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and provide explicability and transparency for recommendations or proposals issued by the system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will also guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services, and ensure that the data is protected in an appropriate manner, using encryption or anonymization if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. technical approach will utilize cloud providers such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), which meet the SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure requirement within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will design a distributed architecture that leverages Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with hybrid deployments and cloud providers to meet the high availability requirement of 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. monitoring tools, including Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack, will ensure the system's performance and availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision will be able to be automated without explicit validation of an agent. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve the required response time of less than 2 seconds, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will utilize Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with inference servers like vLLM, Ollama, and TGI (Hugging Face), and optimize the AI model using fine-tuning methods like LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tune." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. vector databases like Qdrant, Weaviate, and pgvector will also be used to improve query performance. the City of Belval's artificial intelligence solution project will be designed as a tool of assistance, with no decision automated without explicit validation by an agent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will provide a confidence threshold escalation mechanism to explain the reasoning behind recommendations and ensure that the system is transparent and trustworthy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of governance practices, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will establish a steering committee and maintain a RAID log, decision log, and change request process to ensure that all stakeholders are informed and aligned throughout the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
